.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
# `-out=tfplan` is what people actually type, and it matches neither *.tfplan
# nor any rule above. A plan file carries the same secrets the state does --
# the generated RDS master password among them -- so the bare name is ignored
# explicitly rather than relying on everyone remembering a suffix.
tfplan
crash.log
# tfvars may carry endpoints and generated values; secrets belong in SSM (task 6.3)
*.auto.tfvars
parity-report.md
